{"sourceUrl":"https://cgst.cau.edu.cn/art/2025/7/9/art_49907_1075165.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:06.650225+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://cgst.cau.edu.cn/art/2025/7/9/art_49907_1075165.html","html":"<div>\n<h2><span>根据</span><span><span>《中国农业大学</span><span>2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生报名的通知》</span></span><span>，我院</span><span>将开展</span><span>2026</span><span>年接收推荐免试研究生</span><span>报名</span><span>工作</span><span>，欢迎</span><span>有望</span><span>获得本校推荐免试资格的全国各高校优秀应届本科毕业生申请我院研究生</span><span>。</span></h2><h2><span>一、</span><strong><span>接收专业</span></strong></h2><h2><span>090900草学（学硕），095131农艺与种业（专硕），学习方式均为全日制。</span></h2><p><strong><span>二、申报条件</span></strong></p><p><span>（一）系中华人民共和国公民；</span></p><p><span>（二）拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></p><p><span>（三）普通全日制应届本科毕业生，在学期间学习成绩优秀，</span><span>有望取得所在高校推荐免试资格</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>（四）身心健康，符合规定的体检标准。</span></p><p><strong><span>三、报名方式</span></strong></p><p><span><span>推免生报名要求请按照《中国农业大学</span><span>2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生报名的通知</span></span><span><span>》</span></span><a href=\"https://yz.cau.edu.cn/art/2025/7/7/art_41740_1074970.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>https://yz.cau.edu.cn/art/2025/7/7/art_41740_1074970.html</span></span></span></a><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>登录</span><span>“中国农业大学研究生报考服务系统”（</span></span><a href=\"http://yz.cau.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>http://yz.cau.edu.cn/</span></span></span></a><span><span>，请使用</span><span>Windows系统、360浏览器</span></span><span><span>）进行网上申报。学院通过学校报名系统查看报名情况、审核考生申请材料，复试名单及具体安排请关注后续通知，复试形式为线下。</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系人：初老师，联系电话：</span><span>010-62732272。</span></span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"728f4722ae191716353a394906e064b5d6551372b1f94a3e565964c205ac70a4","textLength":505,"sourceSha256":"f10e69c8b4a669ed7ac96d61d7996a41810b8452d80a00a24df035a12a1678aa","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-6f0cb19df9feef190b74","title":"2025年中国农业大学草业科学与技术学院2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:06.650225+00:00"}
